     lambda m: "%s is not on the load path or not built yet. `rocq-live info FILE` shows the flags; "
     "build the library (or set `build` in .rocq-live)" % m.group(1)),
    (r"bad\s+version\s+number|compiled\s+with\s+another\s+version|incompatible\s+version",
     lambda m: "a .vo was built by a different Rocq than the coqtop in use. `rocq-live info FILE` "
